  "steps": [
    "Grind the coconut, cashews, fennel seeds and green chillies with a little water to a smooth paste.",
    "Heat the oil and add the cinnamon, cloves, cardamom and bay leaf.",
    "Add the onions and cook until golden, then add the ginger garlic paste and cook until the raw smell goes.",
    "Add the tomatoes, coriander powder, chilli powder, turmeric and salt and cook until soft.",
    "Stir in the ground paste and the water and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the boiled eggs, simmer 5 minutes and finish with the coriander leaves."
